     4	layer. Code comments and tests cite section numbers in this file (for
     5	example `PLUGIN_SYSTEM.md §4.5`), so keep headings stable when editing.
     6	
     7	This document describes the implementation as it exists now. Historical
     8	implementation plans live under `packages/workspace/docs/plans/archive/`.
     9	For the historical generated/hosted runtime-plugin architecture exploration,
    10	see the archived repo-level
    11	`docs/plans/archive/runtime-plugin-v2-hot-reload-plan.md`.
    12	
