    14	
    15	1. [Glossary](#1-glossary)
    16	2. [End-to-end behaviour](#2-end-to-end-behaviour)
    17	3. [Architecture](#3-architecture)
    18	4. [Public API](#4-public-api)
    19	5. [Key algorithms](#5-key-algorithms)
