   102	## 3. Architecture
   103	
   104	```
   105	App package.json / createWorkspaceAgentServer options
   106	        │
   107	        ▼
   108	resolve default plugin package dirs + explicit plugin entries
   109	        │
   110	        ├─ bootstrapServer(...)          trusted boot-time server plugins
   111	        │     ├─ routes                  Fastify app.register at boot
   112	        │     ├─ agentTools              passed to createAgentApp at boot
   113	        │     ├─ systemPromptAppend      static prompt addendum
   114	        │     ├─ pi packages/skills/exts static Pi resources
   115	        │     └─ provisioning            runtime workspace materialization
   116	        │
   117	        ├─ BoringPluginAssetManager      manifest scan + signatures + SSE
   118	        │     ├─ /api/v1/agent-plugins
   119	        │     ├─ /api/v1/agent-plugins/events
   120	        │     └─ /api/v1/agent-plugins/:id/error
   121	        │
   122	        └─ createAgentApp(...)
   123	              ├─ beforeReload: asset scan + diagnostics + caller hook
   124	              ├─ systemPromptDynamic: plugin `pi.systemPrompt`
   125	              └─ pi.getHotReloadableResources: plugin skills/extensions/packages
   126	
   127	Browser WorkspaceAgentFront
   128	        │
   129	        └─ useAgentPluginHotReload
   130	              ├─ EventSource to /api/v1/agent-plugins/events
   131	              ├─ dynamic import(frontUrl?v=<revision>&t=<salt>)
   132	              └─ registry.replaceByPluginId(...) per output kind
   133	```
   134	
   135	Subpath intent:
   136	
   137	| Subpath | Audience | Contents |
   138	| --- | --- | --- |
   139	| `/plugin` | Front plugin authors | `definePlugin`, front API/types, manifest validators, panel/surface contracts. |
   140	| `/server` | Trusted server plugin authors/hosts | `defineServerPlugin`, server plugin types, asset manager helpers. |
   141	| `/app/server` | App shells | `createWorkspaceAgentServer` and orchestration options. |
   142	| `/app/front` | App shells | `WorkspaceAgentFront`. |
   143	| `/shared` | Runtime-agnostic contracts | Shared types only. |
   144	
